# P12 W1-A1 (Q4, Q5): the snooze cap. An alarm with its 3 snoozes taken
# rings with Dismiss only (no Snooze row); PLAY at its release then
# dismisses (no snooze left): the daily alarm re-arms for tomorrow.
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p12-alarm-snooze.script
# golden: skip capped     (proposed after capture C3)
# env: IPODUI_SIM_ALARM_IN=12,3
# Trace: alarm ring i=0, alarm dismiss how=0, alarm arm rtc= ok=1
# alarm-rings: 1
# log: ipodui: alarm dismiss how=1
# nolog: ipodui: alarm snooze
# reset: mainmenu
wait 16000
shot capped
key PLAY
wait 1500
shot dismissed
quit
